    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Reason Unfound is a short first-person horror game where you hunt for cursed floppy disks containing retro games, reminiscent of Creepypasta. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820440/extras/1c2c25eb2ca6a685d99062aafb09e668.poster.avif?t=1739028475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820440/extras/1c2c25eb2ca6a685d99062aafb09e668.webm?t=1739028475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820440/extras/1c2c25eb2ca6a685d99062aafb09e668.mp4?t=1739028475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover the macabre world of cursed retro games stored on each floppy. As you delve into these unsettling experiences, you'll get closer to understanding the circumstances surrounding your brother's death. The answers may not be straightforward, but each completed game will bring you one step closer to the elusive truth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short horror experience<br></li><li>First-person combat<br></li><li>Atmospheric and eerie locations<br></li><li>Retro aesthetic</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820440/extras/5ccf9f0d880f17251b273f8629ea0288.poster.avif?t=1739028475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820440/extras/5ccf9f0d880f17251b273f8629ea0288.webm?t=1739028475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820440/extras/5ccf9f0d880f17251b273f8629ea0288.mp4?t=1739028475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>",
